THIS WAS FILMED IN JANUARY 2023

Chocolate Orange Cheesecake Ice Cream is a makeshift flavour as I made the cheesecake for Xmas and had some left over in the freezer. You might not want to make an entire cheesecake for this recipe but I uploaded it to give inspiration as it might give you an idea of your own. 

550g Milk
400g Heavy or Double Cream
180g Sugar
50g Dextrose
60g SMP
75g Cocoa Powder

Leftover Chocolate Orange Cheesecake core made with Cheesecake, crème de cacao and milk mixed back up. If I were to do this again, i'd reduce the milk and increase the booze, although you could use vodka or any alcohol you fancy.

Layer in biscuit crumb throughout. 

Ultimately, the result was pretty good but could be improved. 

